<%# Turbo loads this frame once the page has rendered. The response is Turbo Stream actions that fill
    in each result's "Matching text" placeholder, so the frame itself stays empty. Restricted results
    the user may not see have a login prompt instead of a placeholder, so they are not requested. %>
<%= turbo_frame_tag "matching-excerpts", src: matching_excerpts_path(q: params[:q], ids: documents.reject { |document| hide_restricted_text?(document) }.map(&:id)) %>
